<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sable lifts half yr pre-except shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Sable lifts half yr pre-except shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-excepts shr(cts)     105.90   vs   85.50</p>
<p>    Post-exepts shr (cts)     95.40   vs  124.20</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			-	vs   -</p>
<p>    Net income		     7.64   vs    9.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			  6.60   vs    5.53</p>
<p>    Tax				0.40   vs    0.68</p>
<p>    Interest paid		  3.93   vs    1.69</p>
<p>    Turnover			12.47   vs   16.63</p>
<p>Full name: Sable Holdings Ltd (financial-property)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it anticipated headline earnings for the full year to exceed 200 cents per share.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
